  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• In a medium saucepan, heat 1/2 the butter with a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook garlic until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in the boiling water, vegetable stock and couscous.\n• Cover with lid and remove from heat. Set aside until water has absorbed, 5 mins. Fluff up with a fork and season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61d7f9236c005a3c98561fdb/step-7e6f258c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain and rinse chickpeas. In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook tomato paste, garlic seasoning, dried oregano (see ingredients) and chickpeas, until fragrant, 1-2 mins.\n• Reduce heat to medium, then stir in the water and a pinch of sugar and cook until slightly thickened 2-4 mins.\n• Remove from heat. Stir in remaining butter.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61d7f9236c005a3c98561fdb/step-c786a20a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop cucumber and tomato.\n• In a medium bowl, combine cucumber, tomato, mixed salad leaves, a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61d7f9236c005a3c98561fdb/step-2cf83785.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide couscous, chickpeas, and cucumber salad between bowls.\n• Spoon over any sauce from the pan.\n• Crumble over fetta. Top with flaked almonds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61d7f9236c005a3c98561fdb/step-94d90964.jpg"
    }
  ]
